e here before, wishing to do the same. That floating island is quite the view, after all...","nextNodeIds":[751270102]},{"nodeId":751270102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":2946739482,"text":"It's just a shame we didn't have Kamera previously — I had to ask a foreign merchant I knew to get me one.","nextNodeIds":[751270103]},{"nodeId":751270103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":3270595922,"text":"How about it, dear guest? Care for a picture? But you'll have to do it yourself. I'm not exactly a dab hand at photography...","nextNodeIds":[751270104]},{"nodeId":751270104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2323116202,"text":"Strange, there's fog over the sea...","nextNodeIds":[751270105]},{"nodeId":751270105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":2827330082,"text":"Fog? What do you mean? There can't be fog with such a strong sea breeze...","nextNodeIds":[751270106]},{"nodeId":751270106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":1848793602,"text":"I have never seen fog over the sea since the day I was born.","nextNodeIds":[751270107]},{"nodeId":751270107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":3573702818,"text":"Might you have confused this place with the fog-shrouded area that Tezcatepetonco Range overlooks, by any chance?","nextNodeIds":[751270108]},{"nodeId":751270108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3437765538,"text":"Perhaps...","nextNodeIds":[751270109]},{"nodeId":751270109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":4161694882,"text":"Hehe, if you ask me, I'd say you're just too nervous.","nextNodeIds":[751270110]},{"nodeId":751270110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","textMapHash":2429592098,"text":"You should loosen up — you're touring Natlan, after all.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7512701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["21705"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7512701],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21705,"speakerName":"Sakaw","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2989938102,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"21705":[4222]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":751270101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","ILHDNJDDEOP":7512701,"JGFEJPBPHGJ":[],"JNFAMBOFGHJ":false,"KINCAGMDMHH":[21705],"KJLNGKKBBOI":"TALK_MARK_NONE","KNBDEPPFNBN":0,"LCIDOOMOIPM":0,"LIJPPLJCHGI":0,"LMAPLNHKPOH":[],"MBDOOOMPFCD